# Implementation Plan - ApexIntel: AI Motorsport Energy & Overtake Intelligence Platform

Scaffold and build an enterprise-grade full-stack web application titled **"ApexIntel: AI Motorsport Energy & Overtake Intelligence Platform"** featuring a scrollytelling 3D race circuit & vehicle trajectory engine, interactive pit-wall dashboard, opponent behavioral profiler, telemetry sandbox, and a FastAPI backend powered by telemetry mining algorithms.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - The application will include both a Next.js (TypeScript/Tailwind CSS/React Three Fiber/Framer Motion) frontend and a Python 3.11 FastAPI backend.
> - The 3D view is engineered with a custom procedural F1 race car fallback mesh (aerodynamic chassis, front/rear wings, wheels with glow discs, halo safety structure, and ERS energy particle halo) so it runs 100% out-of-the-box without requiring external GLB downloads.
> - Full live backend integration with real-time fallback to client-side mock data generator if the API is offline during frontend standalone preview.

